    "389": {
      "date": "2026-11-10",
      "edition": "Tuesday 10 November",
      "sections": [
        {
          "kicker": "Post-Springboks mood",
          "heading": "Danilo Fischetti says Italy want to show character after Springboks loss",
          "body": "Danilo Fischetti, the Northampton Saints prop who came off the bench in Turin, admits the Springboks game was gone before he arrived. Italy had prepared well during the week, he said, but failed to carry that into the match, leaving the squad frustrated and disappointed. Looking ahead to Saturday's test in Genoa, Fischetti said Italy want to show their character, with the front row decisive against an Argentina side under pressure at set-piece but with plenty of potential."
        },
        {
          "kicker": "Around the world",
