          "kicker": "Ticket pre-sale",
          "heading": "Scotland Supporters Club deadline 23 November for Six Nations pre-sale access",
          "body": "Fans who want priority access to tickets for Scotland's three home fixtures at the 2027 Guinness Men's Six Nations must buy a Scotland Supporters Club membership by midnight on Monday 23 November. The pre-sale opens on Tuesday 24 November, with any remaining tickets going on general sale on Thursday 26 November. SSC Matchday costs £50 a year and includes pre-sale access to Scotland Men's home internationals and both legs of the 1872 Cup. Memberships run January to December, so fans buying now must redeem them come the new year."
