          "kicker": "Attacking intent",
          "heading": "Louis Rees-Zammit urges Wales to be brave against All Blacks in Cardiff",
          "body": "Louis Rees-Zammit, named player of the match against Japan, says Wales must attack the All Blacks rather than shy away from them. He gained 110 metres from 11 runs against Japan, with three clean breaks and 14 defenders beaten. Recalling last year's 52-26 defeat in Cardiff, when Wales were competitive until around the hour mark, he said the team must \"be fearless\" with the ball. \"Next week will be brave and go for it,\" he added, warning that stepping back invites punishment from the All Blacks."
        },
