          "heading": "Italy prop Danilo Fischetti vows reaction against Argentina after South Africa defeat",
          "body": "Italy begin preparations with a prop's warning: Danilo Fischetti said the Azzurri want a response on Saturday, not just a result. Speaking at the press conference after the squad's first day on the grass, he said the group had already dissected the South Africa match together and wants a different performance. He also acknowledged important absences, but said they open chances for others. Argentina should expect an Italy side keen to show their character in Genoa."
