          "kicker": "Injury blow",
          "heading": "Isaac Henry ruled out of remaining November Tests with hamstring strain",
          "body": "The Wallabies confirmed on Tuesday that Isaac Henry will miss the rest of November Tests, having come off in the 58th minute at Twickenham with a hamstring strain. No replacement will join the squad, with the coaching group backing the options it has. Kiss could turn to Filipo Daugunu, who replaced Henry against England, with Kurtley Beale the other centre cover. It makes a sixth different midfield partnership in seven Tests, with Len Ikitau and Joseph-Aukuso Suaalii tipped as the likeliest pairing to face Scotland at Murrayfield."
