          "heading": "Steve Hansen says Dave Rennie has made All Blacks a different team",
          "body": "Speaking to Rugby Unity after Saturday's 43-21 win at Murrayfield, Steve Hansen credited Dave Rennie's environment for an All Blacks side that is, in his words, \"a different team\". He pointed to props scoring from quick taps and said \"There's no passengers. There's no social loafing.\" Hansen also acknowledged the difficult week the squad had in Scotland, following the death at the team hotel of long-serving head of security Logan Cadwallader."
